n. This pattern tends to be context-sensitive rather than fixed: the same emphasis may read louder under stress and softer under safety. Many people with similar encoding describe the feel as more situational than permanent, especially when life load changes week to week.\n\nThe encoded claim MOTION_LABEL_STEADY with relatively strong encoding in the feature field; this may show up as subtle shifts in emphasis rather than a single fixed behavioral label. The encoded claim GRAVITY_LABEL_LIGHT with relatively strong encoding in the feature field; this may show up as subtle shifts in emphasis rather than a single fixed behavioral label. Integration often works better as small experiments than as a single decisive relabeling of the self or the relationship.\n\nThe encoded claim MODALITY_CARDINAL with moderate encoding in the feature field; this may show up as subtle shifts in emphasis rather than a single fixed behavioral label. The encoded claim MODALITY_FIXED with moderate encoding in the feature field; this may show up as subtle shifts in emphasis rather than a single fixed behavioral label. The encoded claim MODALITY_MUTABLE with relatively strong encoding in the feature field; this may show up as subtle shifts in emphasis rather than a single fixed behavioral label.\n\nCompatibility audio framing: this staging follows pair dynamics and interaction pacing from the same core. Composition staging tends to align with mid pacing with moderate phrase windows, balanced density between sparse and full, and moderate harmonic tension staging in the encoded audio envelope. Integration often works better as small experiments than as a single decisive relabeling of the self or the relationship.","short":"Pair field framing: this section reads relational activation as two-person interface dynamics, not ensemble diffusion. Many people with similar encoding describe the feel as more situational than permanent, especially when life load changes week to week. Integration often works