alanced contour, and let rhythm reflect moderate tension. Many people with similar encoding describe the feel as more situational than permanent, especially when life load changes week to week. Integration often works better as small experiments than as a single decisive relabeling of the self or the relationship.\n\nA clustered structural signature often correlates with concentrated emphasis: many threads pulling through the same thematic doorway. The encoded claim STRUCT_ANGULAR_FIRST with relatively strong encoding in the feature field; this may show up as subtle shifts in emphasis rather than a single fixed behavioral label. The encoded claim STRUCT_LUMINARY_BALANCED with relatively strong encoding in the feature field; this may show up as subtle shifts in emphasis rather than a single fixed behavioral label.","title":"Musical Identity and Flow","bullets":["Color: water-weighted palette.","Contour: balanced brightness curve.","Groove: moderate tension pocket."],"sectionId":"musical"},{"meta":{"phaseD":true,"claimIdsReferenced":[],"projection_validation":{"ok":true,"violations":[],"tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline"}},"text":"Overlay audio framing: this staging keeps natal and transit layers visible as parallel threads. Composition staging tends to align with mid pacing with moderate phrase windows, balanced density between sparse and full, and moderate harmonic tension staging in the encoded audio envelope. Integration often works better as small experiments than as a single decisive relabeling of the self or the relationship.","title":"Audio staging (same SemanticCore)","sectionId":"audio_staging"}]},"audio_export_available":false}'::jsonb, '2026-04-10T16:02:31.407Z', '2026-04-10T16:02:31.407Z', NULL);
