g at a pace that is both sustainable and genuinely engaged; This is the sound of a chart that is neither hurried by urgency nor held by gravity, moving forward at the pace of something that is genuinely alive without being driven; Listen for the quality of forward motion without pressure; The music moves because it is going somewhere, not because something is chasing it; The pace has the quality of genuine presence rather than either urgency or restraint.","title":"How this sounds (listen metaphor)","sectionId":"audio_staging"}]},"audio_export_available":false}'::jsonb, '2026-05-05T16:15:08.132Z', '2026-05-05T16:15:08.132Z', NULL);
