"provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your moon is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Uranus meets your natal Moon at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical emotional disruption where your instinctive needs, your emotional patterns, and your sense of interior safety are being revolutionized from the inside.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"This is Uranus landing on the most vulnerable, most instinctive part of you—the Moon, which governs emotional memory, attachment, the body''s pre-cognitive sense of what feels safe and what feels threatening.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"---","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]}]},"transitCuration":{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","SUN_MOON_TRINE","JUPITER_MOON_SEXTILE","MOON_MOON_TRINE","URANUS_MOON_CONJUNCTION"],"natalBodies":["SUN","MOON"],"calendarDate":"2026-05-25","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MOON","URANUS"]},"phase4_composition":{"unitInfeasible":[],"audioThreadRelocated":false},"transitCurationFull":{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","JUPITER_MOON_SEXTILE","MOON_MOON_TRINE","SUN_MOON_TRINE","URANUS_MOON_CONJUNCTION"],"generatedAt":"2026-05-25T14:48:11.267Z","natalBodies":["SUN","MOON"],"calendarDate":"2026-05-25","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MOON","URANUS"]},"projection_validation":{"ok":true,"violations":[],"tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline"}},"text":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 8th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (1st House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\n---\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Libra** (3rd House), forming a trine. The Moon forms a trine to the Sun, 120 degrees in the same elemental family. Your emotional instinct and your conscious identity are drawing from the same source during this 6-8 hour window.\n\n---\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 8th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (1st House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Moon, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between emotional generosity and instinctive wisdom. The sixty-degree geometry means your Moon''s feeling function and Jupiter''s principle of growth can work in compatible territory.\n\n---\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Libra** (3rd House), forming a trine. The Moon forms a trine to its natal position, 120 degrees ahead in the monthly cycle. Your current emotional state and your foundational needs are drawing from the same source.\n\n---\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Uranus meets your natal Moon at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical emotional disruption where your instinctive needs, your emotional patterns, and your sense of interior safety are being revolutionized from the inside. This is Uranus landing on the most vulnerable, most instinctive part of you—the Moon, which governs emotional memory, attachment, the body''s pre-cognitive sense of what feels safe and what feels threatening.\n\n---","title":"Core Identity Architecture","sectionId":"core_identity"}]},"audio_export_available":false}'::jsonb, '2026-05-25T14:48:11.272Z', '2026-05-25T14:48:11.272Z', '{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","JUPITER_MOON_SEXTILE","MOON_MOON_TRINE","SUN_MOON_TRINE","URANUS_MOON_CONJUNCTION"],"generatedAt":"2026-05-25T14:48:11.267Z","natalBodies":["SUN","MOON"],"calendarDate":"2026-05-25","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MOON","URANUS"]}'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO astradio_profile_projection_cache (cache_key_hash, user_id, chart_id, projection_kind, object_identity_hash, response_json, created_at, updated_at, diversification_context) VALUES ('6313f8378c0d5e812ef17f12889bcb601c4a06d4def81bf98bf7321fe9802dd9|ga0', 'usr_ff0e0495d46e1846', 'chart_15bb1c43bf962c73', 'active', 'e184030673e6de07b73321f6b88d5fe49d0b073f55f3fa87086d830a14b6926e', '{"text":{"long":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\n---\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Libra** (3rd House), forming a trine. The Moon forms a trine to the Sun, 120 degrees in the same elemental family. Your emotional instinct and your conscious identity are drawing from the same source during this 6-8 hour window.\n\n---\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Uranus meets your natal Sun at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical identity disruption and revolutionary becoming. This is not a brief transit—Uranus moves slowly enough that this conjunction, especially with retrogrades, can define an entire life chapter.\n\n---\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Moon, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between emotional generosity and instinctive wisdom. The sixty-degree geometry means your Moon''s feeling function and Jupiter''s principle of growth can work in compatible territory.\n\n---\n\nCommunication, Values, and Drive in Current Context\n\n**Your Mercury in Gemini, 11th House**\n\nYour Mercury in Gemini, its home sign, means how you think and communicate is at maximum agility and range.\n\nYour mercury is currently being activated by **transiting Mercury in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction. Your Mercury meets your Mercury at the same degree. This is impossible natally since Mercury is often in one position in your chart.\n\n---","short":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\n---\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Libra** (3rd House), forming a trine. The Moon forms a trine to the Sun, 120 degrees in the same elemental family. Your emotional instinct and your conscious identity are drawing from the same source during this 6-8 hour window.\n\n---\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Uranus meets your natal Sun at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical identity disruption and revolutionary b