ded in physical reality.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"---","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your sun is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Libra** (3rd House), forming a trine.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"The Moon forms a trine to the Sun, 120 degrees in the same elemental family.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"Your emotional instinct and your conscious identity are drawing from the same source during this 6-8 hour window.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"---","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your sun is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Uranus meets your natal Sun at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical identity disruption and revolutionary becoming.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"This is not a brief transit—Uranus moves slowly enough that this conjunction, especially with retrogrades, can define an entire life chapter.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"---","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your moon is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Moon, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between emotional generosity and instinctive wisdom.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The sixty-degree geometry means your Moon''s feeling function and Jupiter''s principle of growth can work in compatible territory.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"---","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]}]},"transitCuration":{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","SUN_MOON_TRINE","URANUS_SUN_CONJUNCTION","JUPITER_MOON_SEXTILE"],"natalBodies":["MOON","SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-05-25","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MOON","URANUS"]},"phase4_composition":{"unitInfeasible":[],"audioThreadRelocated":false},"transitCurationFull":{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_MOON_SEXTILE","JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","SUN_MOON_TRINE","URANUS_SUN_CONJUNCTION","MERCURY_MERCURY_CONJUNCTION"],"generatedAt":"2026-05-25T15:20:12.061Z","natalBodies":["MOON","SUN","MERCURY"],"calendarDate":"2026-05-25","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MOON","URANUS","MERCURY"]}},"text":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\n---\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Libra** (3rd House), forming a trine. The Moon forms a trine to the Sun, 120 degrees in the same elemental family. Your emotional instinct and your conscious identity are drawing from the same source during this 6-8 hour window.\n\n---\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Uranus meets your natal Sun at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical identity disruption and revolutionary becoming. This is not a brief transit—Uranus moves slowly enough that this conjunction, especially with retrogrades, can define an entire life chapter.\n\n---\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Moon, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between emotional generosity and instinctive wisdom. The sixty-degree geometry means your Moon''s feeling function and Jupiter''s principle of growth can work in compatible territory.\n\n---","title":"Core Identity Architecture","sectionId":"core_identity"},{"meta":{"tagged":{"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"text":"Communication, Values, and Drive in Current Context","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"**Your Mercury in Gemini, 11th House**","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your Mercury in Gemini, its home sign, means how you think and communicate is at maximum agility and range.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your mercury is currently being activated by **transiting Mercury in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"Your Mercury meets your Mercury at the same degree.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"This is impossible natally since Mercury is often in one position in your chart.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"---","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]}]},"transitCuration":{"aspectKeys":["MERCURY_MERCURY_CONJUNCTION"],"natalBodies":["MERCURY"],"calendarDate":"2026-05-25","transitBodies":["MERCURY"]},"transitCurationFull":{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_MOON_SEXTILE","JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","SUN_MOON_TRINE","URANUS_SUN_CONJUNCTION","MERCURY_MERCURY_CONJUNCTION"],"generatedAt":"2026-05-25T15:20:12.061Z","natalBodies":["MOON","SUN","MERCURY"],"calendarDate":"2026-05-25","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MOON","URANUS","MERCURY"]},"projection_validation":{"ok":true,"violations":[],"tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline"}},"text":"Communication, Values, and Drive in Current Context\n\n**Your Mercury in Gemini, 11th House**\n\nYour Mercury in Gemini, its home sign, means how you think and communicate is at maximum agility and range.\n\nYour mercury is currently being activated by **transiting Mercury in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction. Your Mercury meets your Mercury at the same degree. This is impossible natally since Mercury is often in one position in your chart.\n\n---","title":"Personal Expression","sectionId":"personal_expression"}]},"audio_export_available":false}'::jsonb, '2026-05-25T15:20:12.070Z', '2026-05-25T15:20:12.070Z', '{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_MOON_SEXTILE","JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","SUN_MOON_TRINE","URANUS_SUN_CONJUNCTION","MERCURY_MERCURY_CONJUNCTION"],"generatedAt":"2026-05-25T15:20:12.061Z","natalBodies":["MOON","SUN","MERCURY"],"calendarDate":"2026-05-25","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MOON","URANUS","MERCURY"]}'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO astradio_profile_projection_cache (cache_key_hash, user_id, chart_id, projection_kind, object_identity_hash, response_json, created_at, updated_at, diversification_context) VALUES ('609597f4b2d4896831450055c7636f10f4436bb8d84391dfb91257c80a349f69|ga0', 'usr_ff0e0495d46e1846', 'chart_15bb1c43bf962c73', 'active', 'bfbcfd2b54c477aaef835275c1f021e47df61810663dd872c2f5f659b854612c', '{"text":{"long":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\n**Listen for:** The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.\n\n---\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (10th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Uranus meets your natal Sun at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical identity disruption and revolutionary becoming. This is not a brief transit—Uranus moves slowly enough that this conjunction, especially with retrogrades, can define an entire life chapter.\n\n**Listen for:** The Sun''s purposeful melodic lines are interrupted by Uranus''s sudden harmonic dislocations in the conjunction.\n\n---\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Moon, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between emotional generosity and instinctive wisdom. The sixty-degree geometry means your Moon''s feeling function and Jupiter''s principle of growth can work in compatible territory.\n\n**Listen for:** The Moon''s emotional instinct is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith without being overwhelmed by it in the sextile.\n\n---\n\nThe tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Moon''s emotional instinct is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith without being overwhelmed by it in the sextile. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.","short":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\n**Listen for:** The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.\n\n---\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transit