ion, activating a multi-year period of radical identity disruption and revolutionary becoming.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"This is not a brief transit—Uranus moves slowly enough that this conjunction, especially with retrogrades, can define an entire life chapter.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Sun''s purposeful melodic lines are interrupted by Uranus''s sudden harmonic dislocations in the conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"---","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your moon is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Moon, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between emotional generosity and instinctive wisdom.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The sixty-degree geometry means your Moon''s feeling function and Jupiter''s principle of growth can work in compatible territory.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Moon''s emotional instinct is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith without being overwhelmed by it in the sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"---","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]}]},"transitCuration":{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","URANUS_SUN_CONJUNCTION","JUPITER_MOON_SEXTILE"],"natalBodies":["MOON","SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-05-25","transitBodies":["JUPITER","URANUS"]},"phase4_composition":{"unitInfeasible":[],"au