antic_core_schema":"semantic_core_v1","canonical_object_hash":"d6cfbb16c683d43179d53f16e182bf0ba7bfe09cc2b117b31d437b8437199290"},"spec":"UnifiedSpecV1.1","sections":[{"meta":{"tagged":{"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"text":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your sun is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Venus forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 2-3 day channel of productive cooperation between your sense of purpose and relational grace.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"Your sense of beauty and your sense of self are operating in compatible modes.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your moon is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Venus forms a sextile to your Moon, 60 degrees of productive exchange between emotional need and relational warmth.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"What your body requires for safety and what Venus finds beautiful can support each other without strain.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Moon''s emotional instinct and Venus''s aesthetic warmth are in easy dialogue in the sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your moon is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Pisces** (8th House), forming a sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"The Moon forms a sextile to its natal position, 60 degrees ahead in the monthly cycle.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"Your current emotional state and your foundational needs are in productive cooperation.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]}]},"transitCuration":{"aspectKeys":["SUN_VENUS_SEXTILE","MOON_VENUS_SEXTILE","MOON_MOON_SEXTILE"],"natalBodies":["SUN","MOON"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-08","transitBodies":["VENUS","MOON"]},"phase4_composition":{"unitInfeasible":[],"audioThreadRelocated":false},"transitCurationFull":{"aspectKeys":["SUN_VENUS_SEXTILE","MOON_VENUS_SEXTILE","MOON_MOON_SEXTILE"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-08T14:58:51.007Z","natalBodies":["SUN","MOON"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-08","transitBodies":["VENUS","MOON"]}},"text":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Venus forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 2-3 day channel of productive cooperation between your sense of purpose and relational grace. Your sense of beauty and your sense of self are operating in compatible modes.\n\nThe Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth.\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Venus forms a sextile to your Moon, 60 degrees of productive exchange between emotional need and relational warmth. What your body requires for safety and what Venus finds beautiful can support each other without strain.\n\nThe Moon''s emotional instinct and Venus''s aesthetic warmth are in easy dialogue in the sextile.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Pisces** (8th House), forming a sextile. The Moon forms a sextile to its natal position, 60 degrees ahead in the monthly cycle. Your current emotional state and your foundational needs are in productive cooperation.\n\nIn the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.","title":"Core Identity Architecture","sectionId":"core_identity"},{"meta":{"tagged":{"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The Moon''s emotional instinct and Venus''s aesthetic warmth are in easy dialogue in the sextile.","provenance":"template"}]}]},"projection_validation":{"ok":true,"violations":[],"tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline"}},"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Moon''s emotional instinct and Venus''s aesthetic warmth are in easy dialogue in the sextile.","title":"Today''s Sound","sectionId":"todays_sound"}]},"audio_export_available":false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-08T14:58:51.013Z', '2026-06-08T14:58:51.013Z', '{"aspectKeys":["SUN_VENUS_SEXTILE","MOON_VENUS_SEXTILE","MOON_MOON_SEXTILE"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-08T14:58:51.007Z","natalBodies":["SUN","MOON"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-08","transitBodies":["VENUS","MOON"]}'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO astradio_profile_projection_cache (cache_key_hash, user_id, chart_id, projection_kind, object_identity_hash, response_json, created_at, updated_at, diversification_context) VALUES ('39e8bce1370675cd34bf75952fcc915af87f2f359421fdc889091f1b8045e720|ga0', 'usr_ff0e0495d46e1846', 'chart_15bb1c43bf962c73', 'active', '4f6056dd9e80fa32b80a7792a814f9c62bbffeb29760fde10051529abc2dd09a', '{"text":{"long":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Venus forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 2-3 day channel of productive cooperation between your sense of purpose and relational grace. Your sense of beauty and your sense of self are operating in compatible modes.\n\nThe Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth.\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Venus forms a sextile to your Moon, 60 degrees of productive exchange between emotional need and relational warmth. What your body requires for safety and what Venus finds beautiful can support each other without strain.\n\nThe Moon''s emotional instinct and Venus''s aesthetic warmth are in easy dialogue in the sextile.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Pisces** (8th House), forming a sextile. The Moon forms a sextile to its natal position, 60 degrees ahead in the monthly cycle. Your current emotional state and your foundational needs are in productive cooperation.\n\nIn the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.\n\nThe tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Moon''s emotional instinct and Venus''s aesthetic warmth are in easy dialogue in the sextile.","short":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Moon''s emotional instinct and Venus''s aesthetic warmth are in easy dialogue in the sextile.","digest":"sha256:5e19696e39f86a9230079229c65edd4b8f93fe8a9033bc4385731212058ac889","bullets":[],"signatures":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Moon''s emotional instinct and Venus''s aesthetic warmth are in easy dialogue in the sextile.","template_id":"semantic-core-v1","significance":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Moon''s emotional instinct and Venus''s aesthetic warmth are in easy dialogue in the sextile.","musicalBullets":[],"musicalParagraph":""},"hashes":{"audio":"d670f7c686a4b7b6709ff5ac4aaf978de9722fdf84b137b7ee9f53b681ad6192","control":"sha256:a1f0262930f35e089734408d5d3b3a65cc5de5d68974bac161aabb58021fe2e7","explanation":"sha256:5e19696e39f86a9230079229c65edd4b8f93fe8a9033bc4385731212058ac889","plan_sha256":"7e59fd77655b90cf91a264193ad0b1f6d9e13140868d51d843c543ef0eb2