s that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your sun is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Uranus meets your natal Sun at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical identity disruption and revolutionary becoming.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"This is not a brief transit.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Sun''s purposeful melodic lines are interrupted by Uranus''s sudden harmonic dislocations in the conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]}]},"transitCuration":{"aspectKeys":["SUN_VENUS_SEXTILE","JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","URANUS_SUN_CONJUNCTION"],"natalBodies":["SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-10","transitBodies":["VENUS","JUPITER","URANUS"]},"phase4_composition":{"unitInfeasible":[],"audioThreadRelocated":false},"transitCurationFull":{"aspectKeys":["SUN_VENUS_SEXTILE","JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","URANUS_SUN_CONJUNCTION"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-10T15:00:36.304Z","natalBodies":["SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-10","transitBodies":["VENUS","JUPITER","URANUS"]}},"text":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Venus forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 2-3 day channel of productive cooperation between your sense of purpose and relational grace. Your sense of beauty and your sense of self are operating in compatible modes.\n\nThe Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\nThe Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (11th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Uranus meets your natal Sun at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical identity disruption and revolutionary becoming. This is not a brief transit.\n\nThe Sun''s purposeful melodic lines are interrupted by Uranus''s sudden harmonic dislocations in the conjunction.","title":"Core Identity Architecture","sectionId":"core_identity"},{"meta":{"tagged":{"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.","provenance":"template"}]}]},"projection_validation":{"ok":true,"violations":[],"tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline"}},"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.","title":"Today''s Sound","sectionId":"todays_sound"}]},"audio_export_available":false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-10T15:00:36.319Z', '2026-06-10T15:00:36.319Z', '{"aspectKeys":["SUN_VENUS_SEXTILE","JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","URANUS_SUN_CONJUNCTION"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-10T15:00:36.304Z","natalBodies":["SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-10","transitBodies":["VENUS","JUPITER","URANUS"]}'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO astradio_profile_projection_cache (cache_key_hash, user_id, chart_id, projection_kind, object_identity_hash, response_json, created_at, updated_at, diversification_context) VALUES ('65f9636d479c3b72e9cd08db458494e5554405b279f345ae873425acf4dbfba7|ga0', 'usr_ff0e0495d46e1846', 'chart_15bb1c43bf962c73', 'active', '031c3f795fadde92d9324c342c90d243ebfbd07069246a9d9dca048de8e96d45', '{"text":{"long":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Venus forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 2-3 day channel of productive cooperation between your sense of purpose and relational grace. Your sense of beauty and your sense of self are operating in compatible modes.\n\nThe Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\nThe Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Uranus in Gemini** (10th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Uranus meets your natal Sun at conjunction, activating a multi-year period of radical identity disruption and revolutionary becoming. This is not a brief transit.\n\nThe Sun''s purposeful melodic lines are interrupted by Uranus''s sudden harmonic dislocations in the conjunction.\n\nThe tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.","short":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.","digest":"sha256:4db607a62d22615888946447beea661427ff40175f142927e1882709141d886b","bullets":[],"signatures":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.","template_id":"semantic-core-v1","significance":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun provides the directional architecture and Venus decorates that architecture with genuine aesthetic warmth. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, produci