:\"2026-06-14T17:57:00.000Z\",\"tz\":\"America/Chicago\"}"},"export_id":null,"fromCache":false,"explanation":{"meta":{"engine":"semantic-core-v1","phase_d":{"tier":"baseline","surface":"overlay_pair","tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline","projection_validation":{"ok":true,"violations":[],"tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline"}},"claim_count":15,"factorCount":0,"hasFactorMap":false,"engineVersion":"phase-b-1","semantic_core_schema":"semantic_core_v1","canonical_object_hash":"8d4a9980510373b2bc3eebdb9bb893978d285973361c4d0df36b13d953396a2e"},"spec":"UnifiedSpecV1.1","sections":[{"meta":{"tagged":{"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"text":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your sun is currently being activated by **transiting Mars in Taurus** (9th House), forming a conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Mars meets your natal Sun at the same degree, fusing your conscious identity with drive, assertion, and physical force during this 2-3 day window.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"Who you are and what you''re moved to fight for arrive at the same frequency.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Sun contributes its assertive, purposeful melodic direction and clear forward pulse.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (11th House), forming a sextile.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your moon is currently being activated by **transiting Mars in Taurus** (9th House), forming a conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"The Moon, emotional instinct and reactive need, meets Mars, drive and physical force, at the same degree.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"What you feel and what you pursue aren''t separate during this 6-8 hour window.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Moon''s emotional instinct and Mars''s action-drive are fused rather than sequential in the conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]}]},"transitCuration":{"aspectKeys":["SUN_MARS_CONJUNCTION","JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","MOON_MARS_CONJUNCTION"],"natalBodies":["MOON","SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-14","transitBodies":["MARS","JUPITER"]},"phase4_composition":{"unitInfeasible":[],"audioThreadRelocated":false},"transitCurationFull":{"aspectKeys":["MOON_MARS_CONJUNCTION","SUN_MARS_CONJUNCTION","JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-14T17:57:52.135Z","natalBodies":["MOON","SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-14","transitBodies":["MARS","JUPITER"]}},"text":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Mars in Taurus** (9th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Mars meets your natal Sun at the same degree, fusing your conscious identity with drive, assertion, and physical force during this 2-3 day window. Who you are and what you''re moved to fight for arrive at the same frequency.\n\nThe Sun contributes its assertive, purposeful melodic direction and clear forward pulse.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (11th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\nThe Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Mars in Taurus** (9th House), forming a conjunction. The Moon, emotional instinct and reactive need, meets Mars, drive and physical force, at the same degree. What you feel and what you pursue aren''t separate during this 6-8 hour window.\n\nThe Moon''s emotional instinct and Mars''s action-drive are fused rather than sequential in the conjunction.","title":"Core Identity Architecture","sectionId":"core_identity"},{"meta":{"tagged":{"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The Moon''s emotional instinct and Mars''s action-drive are fused rather than sequential in the conjunction.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The Sun contributes its assertive, purposeful melodic direction and clear forward pulse.","provenance":"template"}]}]},"projection_validation":{"ok":true,"violations":[],"tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline"}},"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Moon''s emotional instinct and Mars''s action-drive are fused rather than sequential in the conjunction. The Sun contributes its assertive, purposeful melodic direction and clear forward pulse.","title":"Today''s Sound","sectionId":"todays_sound"}]},"audio_export_available":false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-14T17:57:52.139Z', '2026-06-14T17:57:52.139Z', '{"aspectKeys":["MOON_MARS_CONJUNCTION","SUN_MARS_CONJUNCTION","JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-14T17:57:52.135Z","natalBodies":["MOON","SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-14","transitBodies":["MARS","JUPITER"]}'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO astradio_profile_projection_cache (cache_key_hash, user_id, chart_id, projection_kind, object_identity_hash, response_json, created_at, updated_at, diversification_context) VALUES ('47c47b3afd23adadb967b918640338baa6a73f81c50cbec77556c263ccad7078|ga0', NULL, 'chart_0a1848b0d84b0b2a', 'active', '6c9f82ad1d486dbf4884308e9879e13c446f455ed1c767ea73e0775a9c06f10c', '{"text":{"long":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Virgo, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Virgo means your sense of purpose is organized around precision, useful service, and making things work better than they currently do.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Mercury in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Sun forms a sextile to your natal Mercury, 60 degrees of productive cooperation. Identity and communication are operating in compatible modes during this 1-2 day period.\n\nThe Sun contributes its steady purposeful pulse and clear melodic direction.\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 6th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Cancer** (11th House), forming a sextile. The Moon forms a sextile to its natal position, 60 degrees ahead in the monthly cycle. Your current emotional state and your foundational needs are in productive cooperation.\n\nIn the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Leo** (1st House), forming a square. The Moon forms a square to Venus, 90 degrees of sustained friction between emotional need and relational attunement. What your body needs for safety and what creates aesthetic harmony are cutting across each other during this 6-8 hour period.\n\nThe Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth.\n\nThe tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers. The Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth.","short":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers. The Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth.","digest":"sha256:7283dab67146e2cadfe71ccf0b4c62585e2bf68f3ba1931450a192835d917aa4","bullets":[],"signatures":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers. The Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth.","template_id":"semantic-core-v1","significance":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territor