SUN_MERCURY_SEXTILE","MOON_MOON_SEXTILE","MOON_VENUS_SQUARE"],"natalBodies":["MOON","SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-15","transitBodies":["MOON","VENUS","MERCURY"]},"phase4_composition":{"unitInfeasible":[],"audioThreadRelocated":false},"transitCurationFull":{"aspectKeys":["MOON_MOON_SEXTILE","MOON_VENUS_SQUARE","SUN_MERCURY_SEXTILE"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-15T15:28:44.832Z","natalBodies":["MOON","SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-15","transitBodies":["MOON","VENUS","MERCURY"]}},"text":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Virgo, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Virgo means your sense of purpose is organized around precision, useful service, and making things work better than they currently do.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Mercury in Cancer** (12th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Sun forms a sextile to your natal Mercury, 60 degrees of productive cooperation. Identity and communication are operating in compatible modes during this 1-2 day period.\n\nThe Sun contributes its steady purposeful pulse and clear melodic direction.\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 6th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Cancer** (11th House), forming a sextile. The Moon forms a sextile to its natal position, 60 degrees ahead in the monthly cycle. Your current emotional state and your foundational needs are in productive cooperation.\n\nIn the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Leo** (12th House), forming a square. The Moon forms a square to Venus, 90 degrees of sustained friction between emotional need and relational attunement. What your body needs for safety and what creates aesthetic harmony are cutting across each other during this 6-8 hour period.\n\nThe Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth.","title":"Core Identity Architecture","sectionId":"core_identity"},{"meta":{"tagged":{"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth.","provenance":"template"}]}]},"projection_validation":{"ok":true,"violations":[],"tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline"}},"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers. The Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth.","title":"Today''s Sound","sectionId":"todays_sound"}]},"audio_export_available":false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-15T15:28:44.922Z', '2026-06-15T15:28:44.922Z', '{"aspectKeys":["MOON_MOON_SEXTILE","MOON_VENUS_SQUARE","SUN_MERCURY_SEXTILE"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-15T15:28:44.832Z","natalBodies":["MOON","SUN"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-15","transitBodies":["MOON","VENUS","MERCURY"]}'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO astradio_profile_projection_cache (cache_key_hash, user_id, chart_id, projection_kind, object_identity_hash, response_json, created_at, updated_at, diversification_context) VALUES ('8b0e6494f1d497f7724d4bfbb8203f15e76ef10297ed8344bfd6a2418ff7f49e|ga0', 'usr_35bffa77cbb8916e', 'chart_b28eac28b599fb25', 'active', '1af242d492c408f0f54fe00fe783aebd9edf7e176fcf1380e2a289e6c89a60a1', '{"text":{"long":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Virgo, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Virgo means your sense of purpose is organized around precision, useful service, and making things work better than they currently do.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Mercury in Cancer** (11th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Sun forms a sextile to your natal Mercury, 60 degrees of productive cooperation. Identity and communication are operating in compatible modes during this 1-2 day period.\n\nThe Sun contributes its steady purposeful pulse and clear melodic direction.\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 6th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Venus in Leo** (12th House), forming a square. The Moon forms a square to Venus, 90 degrees of sustained friction between emotional need and relational attunement. What your body needs for safety and what creates aesthetic harmony are cutting across each other during this 6-8 hour period.\n\nThe Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Cancer** (11th House), forming a sextile. The Moon forms a sextile to its natal position, 60 degrees ahead in the monthly cycle. Your current emotional state and your foundational needs are in productive cooperation.\n\nIn the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.\n\nThe tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture. The Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.","short":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture. The Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.","digest":"sha256:219de838874a53f5c84c8a0c269400eede80c667e96c62bd4f1149ad418fdc62","bullets":[],"signatures":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture. The Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.","template_id":"semantic-core-v1","significance":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a patient, unhurried pace, with a spacious, open harmonic texture. The Moon''s modal harmonic ambiguity, breathing rhythm, and memory-driven emotional cycling are in friction with Venus''s rich consonant beauty, graceful flow, and aesthetic melodic warmth. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.","musicalBullets":[],"musicalParagraph":""},"hashes":{"audio":"d670f7c686a4b7b6709ff5ac4aaf978de9722fdf84b137b7ee9f53b681ad6192","control":"sha256:8bf8da24d0aaacd686bc67f66d0fe61ef36460579371ebb98d1c0d5003c37c55","explanation":"sha256:219de838874a53f5c84c8a0c269400eede80c667e96c62bd4f1149ad418fdc62","plan_sha256":"12de67419f12317e5ddbc65a725bb0b6b73cdbf9138459171c4bc4a73180526a"},"identity":{"projection":"active","compose_seed":"dd71eed0b607913531e7f0be182261fe22b726f92419f7c180562e14d08703e6","surface_kind":"comparison_pair","object_identity_hash":"1af242d492c408f0f54fe00fe783aebd9edf7e176fcf1380e2a289e6c89a60a1","transit_snapshot_hash":"d3cbfb61221de6d5e024166d75c3e5f329f734291397036b789f2fb323feacf2","profile_contract_version":1,"natal_snapshot_fingerprint":"{\"aspects\":[{\"bodyA\":\"venus\",\"bodyB\":\"mars\",\"dynamics\":\"supportive\",\"exactAngle\":59.81,\"exactness\":0.95,\"orb\":0.19,\"priorityBase\":0.91,\"strength\":0.95,\"type\":\"sextile\"},{\"bodyA\":\"sun\",\"bodyB\":\"saturn\",\"dynamics\":\"amplifying\",\"exactAngle\":0.76,\"exactness\":0.9,\"orb\":0.76,\"priorityBase\":0.89,\"strength\":0.9,\"type\":\"conjunction\"},{\"bodyA\":\"neptune\",\"bodyB\":\"pluto\",\"dynamics\":\"supportive\",\"exactAngle\":59.89,\"exactness\":0.97,\"orb\":0.11,\"priorityBase\":0.85,\"strength\":0.97,\"type\":\"sextile\"},{\"bodyA\":\"saturn\",\"bodyB\":\"neptune\",\"dynamics\":\"tense\",\"exactAngle\":90.61,\"exactness\":0.9,\"orb\":0.61,\"priorityBase\":0.82,\"strength\":0.9,\"type\":\"square\"},{\"bodyA\":\"saturn\",\"bodyB\":\"uranus\",\"dynamics\":\"supportive\",\"exactAngle\":60.65,\"exactness\":0.84,\"orb\":0.65,\"priorityBase\":0.79,\"strength\":0.84,\"type\":\"sextile\"},{\"bodyA\":\