y won''t be taken away.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"Your moon is currently being activated by **transiting Mars in Taurus** (9th House), forming a conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"},{"text":"The Moon, emotional instinct and reactive need, meets Mars, drive and physical force, at the same degree.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"What you feel and what you pursue aren''t separate during this 6-8 hour window.","provenance":"template"}]},{"sentences":[{"text":"The Moon''s emotional instinct and Mars''s action-drive are fused rather than sequential in the conjunction.","provenance":"padding","contentProvenance":"template"}]}]},"transitCuration":{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","SUN_MARS_CONJUNCTION","MOON_MARS_CONJUNCTION"],"natalBodies":["SUN","MOON"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-16","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MARS"]},"phase4_composition":{"unitInfeasible":[],"audioThreadRelocated":false},"transitCurationFull":{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","SUN_MARS_CONJUNCTION","MOON_MARS_CONJUNCTION"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-16T16:46:58.155Z","natalBodies":["SUN","MOON"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-16","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MARS"]}},"text":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (11th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\nThe Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Mars in Taurus** (9th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Mars meets your natal Sun at the same degree, fusing your conscious identity with drive, assertion, and physical force during this 2-3 day window. Who you are and what you''re moved to fight for arrive at the same frequency.\n\nThe Sun contributes its assertive, purposeful melodic direction and clear forward pulse.\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Mars in Taurus** (9th House), forming a conjunction. The Moon, emotional instinct and reactive need, meets Mars, drive and physical force, at the same degree. What you feel and what you pursue aren''t separate during this 6-8 hour window.\n\nThe Moon''s emotional instinct and Mars''s action-drive are fused rather than sequential in the conjunction.","title":"Core Identity Architecture","sectionId":"core_identity"},{"meta":{"tagged":{"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.","provenance":"template"},{"text":"The Sun contributes its assertive, purposeful melodic direction and clear forward pulse.","provenance":"template"}]}]},"projection_validation":{"ok":true,"violations":[],"tierEffective":"baseline","tierRequested":"baseline"}},"text":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction. The Sun contributes its assertive, purposeful melodic direction and clear forward pulse.","title":"Today''s Sound","sectionId":"todays_sound"}]},"audio_export_available":false}'::jsonb, '2026-06-16T16:46:58.159Z', '2026-06-16T16:46:58.159Z', '{"aspectKeys":["JUPITER_SUN_SEXTILE","SUN_MARS_CONJUNCTION","MOON_MARS_CONJUNCTION"],"generatedAt":"2026-06-16T16:46:58.155Z","natalBodies":["SUN","MOON"],"calendarDate":"2026-06-16","transitBodies":["JUPITER","MARS"]}'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO astradio_profile_projection_cache (cache_key_hash, user_id, chart_id, projection_kind, object_identity_hash, response_json, created_at, updated_at, diversification_context) VALUES ('bda9c738068bbf70cd097b9d9e9b92dbb396d21a37583fbafa13ae6cf57849b3|ga0', 'usr_ff0e0495d46e1846', 'chart_15bb1c43bf962c73', 'active', 'e7d8feca511a465f986f45ccf5dc90c8f9ef33aaf46d86221677c13599892d58', '{"text":{"long":"Fundamental Self-Expression Under Current Influence\n\n**Your Sun in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Sun in Taurus means your sense of purpose is organized around building something lasting, creating tangible value, and staying grounded in physical reality.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Jupiter in Cancer** (9th House), forming a sextile. Transiting Jupiter forms a sextile to your natal Sun, opening a 1-2 week channel of easy cooperation between your sense of purpose and the arrival of genuine opportunity. The sixty-degree geometry means expansion and direction can work in compatible territory.\n\nThe Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its sense of direction.\n\nYour sun is currently being activated by **transiting Mars in Taurus** (7th House), forming a conjunction. Transiting Mars meets your natal Sun at the same degree, fusing your conscious identity with drive, assertion, and physical force during this 2-3 day window. Who you are and what you''re moved to fight for arrive at the same frequency.\n\nThe Sun contributes its assertive, purposeful melodic direction and clear forward pulse.\n\n**Your Moon in Taurus, 10th House**\n\nYour Moon in Taurus means your emotional body needs physical comfort, material security, and the reassurance that safety won''t be taken away.\n\nYour moon is currently being activated by **transiting Moon in Cancer** (9th House), forming a sextile. The Moon forms a sextile to its natal position, 60 degrees ahead in the monthly cycle. Your current emotional state and your foundational needs are in productive cooperation.\n\nIn the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers.\n\nThe tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its.","short":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its.","digest":"sha256:a13531aa9e073c159840fcd2808ff3b2eab04e0d763c6d8d0d0a4d057c4dd7ac","bullets":[],"signatures":"The tempo of today''s transits moves at a steady, present pace, with a balanced harmonic texture. In the sextile of Moon with itself, the two lunar voices would operate in neighboring harmonic territories, each moving with instinctual rhythm but from different modal centers. The Sun''s directional clarity is supported by Jupiter''s expansive faith in the sextile, producing melodic lines that reach with confidence and harmonic language that covers more territory than expected without losing its.","templa