nd simply track your body, thoughts, and environment for a few breaths."},"user_id":"usr_8a93c883f02eef25","choice_id":"pause_observe","member_id":"chart_49471f32777e5505","response_label":"Pause and observe","outcome_patch_id":"patch_observe_hold_transformation","response_path_id":"pause_observe","response_posture":"observe","response_pattern_tag":"pause_observe"},{"outcome":{"sceneId":"scene:2026-04-06T12:00:00Z:7:invitation:thresholds:water","choiceId":"delay_action","narrative":"You chose to delay action on purpose. This tends to reduce exposure and protect capacity in trust, exchange, and deeper entanglements, while it may slow contact or visible progress. The pressure remains active around trust, exchange, and deeper entanglements, and this posture changes what gets strengthened first.","provenance":{"lifeArea":"thresholds","pressureType":"invitation","natalSnapshot":{"ts":"","tz":"UTC","lat":0,"lon":0},"primaryDomain":"transformation","transitSnapshot":{"ts":"","tz":"UTC","lat":0,"lon":0},"responsePatternTag":"delay_action"},"symbolicMeaning":"This choice is a way of working with the active pressure in shared thresholds, trust, and deeper entanglements. It honors timing as part of the work, treating conscious delay as different from avoidance.","realWorldReflection":"In the next day, where does this show up around shared thresholds, trust, and deeper entanglements? Put a specific check-in time on your calendar to revisit the situation, so the delay stays conscious rather than vague."},"user_id":"usr_96211f40f08d9cb2","choice_id":"delay_action","member_id":"chart_f1b99aed3d1c9bd0","response_label":"Delay action on purpose","outcome_patch_id":"patch_withdraw_protect_transformation","response_path_id":"delay_action","response_posture":"withdraw","response_pattern_tag":"delay_action"}]}}'::jsonb, '7a5ba6310890af6f25662d4a9ebe913e3a0e04f183a959589935ab5ad9049125', 'e278204852a7a261e3f7c9406d1c8958d3a849a238c6c4c3464d088e7e58bbab', '2026-04-01T18:00:21.062Z');
INSERT INTO campaign_daily_state (campaign_id, calendar_date, engine_version, mode, anchor_user_id, transit_context_json, transit_context_fingerprint, daily_state_json, daily_state_hash, derivation_inputs_fingerprint, created_at) VALUES ('stage5_a9f7b326f7825564', '2026-04-24T05:00:00.000Z', 'campaign_daily_phase1_v1', 'group', 'usr_96211f40f08d9cb2', '{"lat":40.7128,"lon":-74.006,"label":"NYC","source":"browser_geo","timezone":"America/New_York","resolvedAt":"2026-03-31T19:17:51.015Z"}'::jsonb, 'afc08e91aaebb579ab5fa47bd574da0d846c6af81bd17abd60bd01b4ebd239d9', '{"meta":{"campaign_id":"stage5_a9f7b326f7825564","phase1_rules":"campaign_contract_v1","calendar_date":"2026-04-24","phase1_engine":"campaign_phase1_v1","anchor_user_id":"usr_96211f40f08d9cb2","transit_context_fingerprint":"afc08e91aaebb579ab5fa47bd574da0d846c6af81bd17abd60bd01b4ebd239d9","derivation_inputs_fingerprint":"efdce34b08797da17b100ab7f2810d34981f7f10e38d677efbf99ad0425d6ffb"},"daily":{"mode":"group","challenge":{"id":"scene:2026-04-24T12:00:00Z:9:invitation:work_public:water","theme":"The chart emphasizes water tones with balanced overall coloring and moderate structural tension in the feature field. Today''s challenge centers on work, responsibility, and daily systems, with a chance to align effort with the role you want to hold. A secondary layer in conviction, horizon, and meaning-making brings the issue close and immediate, which makes pacing more important than force. Together, the pressures read as transforming rather than isolated. Recent turns have leaned toward protecting capacity and reducing unnecessary exposure.","choices":[{"id":"push_forward","label":"Push forward with intention","posture":"engage","modality":"decisive","patternTag":"push_forward","riskProfile":"This creates momentum quickly, but it can still drift if you assume ease will carry it on its own and can amplify strain if the conditions are still unstable. This tends to increase movement and agency in work, responsibility, and daily systems, while it can outrun the conditions if momentum becomes the only priority.","symbolicGesture":"Take one deliberate step in how you organize effort and obligations that moves the situation without pretending conditions are perfect.","outcomeDirection":"engage_advance"},{"id":"reframe_pattern","label":"Reframe the pattern","posture":"reframe","modality":"interpretive","patternTag":"reframe_pattern","riskProfile":"This supports flexibility and integration, but it can still drift if you assume ease will carry it on its own and may under-act if interpretation replaces contact. This tends to increase coherence and flexibility in work, responsibility, and daily systems, while it may delay action if interpretation becomes a substitute for movement.","symbolicGesture":"Rename what this moment means in how you organize effort and obligations so you can meet it with more flexibility and less automatic compression.","outcomeDirection":"reframe_integrate"},{"id":"name_truth","label":"Name the truth directly","posture":"assert","modality":"direct","patternTag":"name_truth","riskProfile":"This increases definition quickly, but it can still drift if you assume ease will carry it on its own and can raise direct friction when the pressure is already difficult to ignore. This tends to strengthen clarity and definition in work, responsibility, and daily systems, while it can raise friction before the situation settles.","symbolicGesture":"Define what is true for you in how you organize effort and obligations with one clean sentence rather than letting the tension speak for you.","outcomeDirection":"assert_define"},{"id":"draw_boundary","label":"Draw a boundary","posture":"contain","modality":"bounded","patternTag":"draw_boundary","riskProfile":"This protects capacity and steadiness, but it can still drift if you assume ease will carry it on its own and can harden distance if the limit lands too rigidly. This tends to stabilize capacity by narrowing scope in work, responsibility, and daily systems, while it may create distance if the limit lands too rigidly.","symbolicGesture":"Narrow the scope of how you organize effort and obligations to what you can actually carry, protect, or decide right now.","outcomeDirection":"contain_limit"},{"id":"pause_observe","label":"Pause and observe","posture":"observe","modality":"reflective","patternTag":"pause_observe","riskProfile":"This protects clarity before commitment, but it can still drift if you assume ease will carry it on its own and may preserve ambiguity intensely longer. This tends to preserve optionality while delaying commitment in work, responsibility, and daily systems, while it may leave uncertainty in place for longer.","symbolicGesture":"Clarify what is actually happening around how you organize effort and obligations before you commit to a move, especially while the pressure remains difficult to ignore.","outcomeDirection":"observe_hold"}],"setting":"a work setting where labor, responsibility, or systems are visible, with a reflective pace that keeps the pressure readable","obstacle":"This reads as difficult to ignore pressure that brings the issue close and immediate around how you organize effort and obligations, carrying a possibility, scale, and future-facing belief emphasis through your labor, health, and repeatable systems. The tradeoff is that it can still drift if you assume ease will carry it on its own. older coping patterns may feel closer to the surface.","archetypeId":"duty_alignment","primaryPressure":{"id":"760c4e46028127f68a07a6bb302331d60f7370383a3388c8226923684210379e","type":"invitation","domain":"work","lifeArea":"work_public","intensity":0.8348,"natalBody":"jupiter","aspectType":"conjunction","growthPath":"phase1_growth:none","natalHouse":6,"transitBody":"moon","intensityBand":"critical","memberChartId":"chart_f1b99aed3d1c9bd0","pressureFamily":"emotional","contributingDomains":[{"score":0.8348,"domain":"campaign_work","normalizedScore":0.8348,"contr