d social position, while it may leave uncertainty in place for longer.","symbolicGesture":"Slow the first reaction long enough to read what is really happening around how you participate in group life, rather than answering the first spike of pressure.","outcomeDirection":"observe_hold"},{"id":"name_truth","label":"Name the truth directly","posture":"assert","modality":"direct","patternTag":"name_truth","riskProfile":"This increases definition quickly, but it can harden quickly if met too bluntly and can raise direct friction when the pressure is already difficult to ignore. This tends to strengthen clarity and definition in belonging, contribution, and social position, while it can raise friction before the situation settles.","symbolicGesture":"Define what is true for you in how you participate in group life with one clean sentence rather than letting the tension speak for you.","outcomeDirection":"assert_define"},{"id":"seek_counsel","label":"Seek counsel","posture":"support","modality":"relational","patternTag":"seek_counsel","riskProfile":"This builds connection and perspective, but it can harden quickly if met too bluntly and may slow solitary momentum while the larger picture comes into view. This tends to strengthen trust, perspective, or alliance in belonging, contribution, and social position, while it may reduce solitary momentum while perspective catches up.","symbolicGesture":"Bring this part of how you participate in group life to someone trustworthy so perspective becomes part of the response instead of staying solitary.","outcomeDirection":"support_connect"},{"id":"delay_action","label":"Delay action on purpose","posture":"withdraw","modality":"protective","patternTag":"delay_action","riskProfile":"This reduces immediate exposure, but it can harden quickly if met too bluntly and can prolong uncertainty if the retreat becomes indefinite. This tends to reduce exposure and protect capacity in belonging, contribution, and social position, while it may slow contact or visible progress.","symbolicGesture":"Step back from direct contact in how you participate in group life long enough to regain timing control, then revisit it deliberately.","outcomeDirection":"withdraw_protect"}],"setting":"a group setting where belonging, contribution, or social position is in motion, with a reflective pace that keeps the pressure readable","obstacle":"The pressure is difficult to ignore and sharp enough to expose strain: it creates friction that asks for adjustment around how you participate in group life, with extra emphasis on your alliances, networks, and shared belonging and instability, surprise, and deviation from routine. The tradeoff is that it can harden quickly if met too bluntly. older coping patterns may feel closer to the surface.","archetypeId":"bond_friction","primaryPressure":{"id":"52480d2c599b58ab9f633d94d8e22da55bd4a6355efbae2520da1a540ab814b7","type":"confusion","domain":"community","lifeArea":"community","intensity":0.8425,"natalBody":"uranus","aspectType":"square","growthPath":"phase1_growth:none","natalHouse":11,"transitBody":"mercury","intensityBand":"critical","pressureFamily":"cognitive","contributingDomains":[{"score":0.8425,"domain":"campaign_community","normalizedScore":0.8425,"contributingSignals":[]}],"likelyShadowPattern":"phase1_shadow:frictional"},"archetypeCategory":"bond_friction","supportingPressures":[{"id":"c08c0d02b12d8d593beae8a7465eaaa13fd0f2b984989f8d22ff9ffefeb00995","type":"invitation","domain":"communication","lifeArea":"communication","intensity":0.7646,"natalBody":"mars","aspectType":"conjunction","growthPath":"phase1_growth:none","natalHouse":3,"transitBody":"venus","intensityBand":"high","pressureFamily":"value","contributingDomains":[{"score":0.7646,"domain":"campaign_communication","normalizedScore":0.7646,"contributingSignals":[]}],"likelyShadowPattern":"phase1_shadow:volatile"},{"id":"843f149b74f63f9a661c8d2da775dc6ca227f987b3ac449b0627e0e0581de393","type":"conflict","domain":"co