ave uncertainty in place for longer.","symbolicGesture":"Clarify what is actually happening around how you define yourself in motion before you commit to a move, especially while the pressure remains difficult to ignore.","outcomeDirection":"observe_hold"},{"id":"name_truth","label":"Name the truth directly","posture":"assert","modality":"direct","patternTag":"name_truth","riskProfile":"This increases definition quickly, but it can still drift if you assume ease will carry it on its own and can raise direct friction when the pressure is already difficult to ignore. This tends to strengthen clarity and definition in your sense of self and direction, while it can raise friction before the situation settles.","symbolicGesture":"State one clear line about how you define yourself in motion so the situation is less implied and more directly named.","outcomeDirection":"assert_define"},{"id":"reframe_pattern","label":"Reframe the pattern","posture":"reframe","modality":"interpretive","patternTag":"reframe_pattern","riskProfile":"This supports flexibility and integration, but it can still drift if you assume ease will carry it on its own and may under-act if interpretation replaces contact. This tends to increase coherence and flexibility in your sense of self and direction, while it may delay action if interpretation becomes a substitute for movement.","symbolicGesture":"Change the interpretation around how you define yourself in motion so your next move comes from a different frame instead of the loudest first story.","outcomeDirection":"reframe_integrate"},{"id":"seek_counsel","label":"Seek counsel","posture":"support","modality":"relational","patternTag":"seek_counsel","riskProfile":"This builds connection and perspective, but it can still drift if you assume ease will carry it on its own and may slow solitary momentum while the larger picture comes into view. This tends to strengthen trust, perspective, or alliance in your sense of self and direction, while it may reduc